WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:07.120
Miya-sama!

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.300
Miya-sama!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.000
Miya-sama!

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.680
I'm sorry Nanako-san. NI'm truly sorry.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.090
I just wanted you to swim with me.

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:40.360
Are you okay, Nanako-san?

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:42.560
I'm fine.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:44.230
I'm sorry.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:51.320
{ b1}23. The Forbidden Gift{ b0}

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:17.530
My Dear Brother... this Nis my first real truancy.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:26.800
After what happened, NI couldn't face school today.

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:33.740
I still feel overwhelmed by Nall that happened there.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:38.010
I want to avoid dealing Nwith reality a while longer.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.620
How are you? How's your fever?

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:48.000
Just a bit tired, that's all.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.290
I'll feel better this afternoon.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.030
Try some hot lemonade.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:55.770
Oh, thank you, Mother.

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:59.700
I can call a taxi to take Nyou to the hospital...

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:04.240
OK. If my fever goes over 36.7.

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:09.910
Sorry, Mother...

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:20.920
A cold?

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:24.850
Yes, she has a low Nfever and feels weak.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:29.430
She called as I was leaving, Nso I couldn't really talk.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:30.600
I see.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:34.270
I can give her a message, if you like.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:37.340
I'm stopping at her Nhouse on my way home.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.740
Never mind. Thank you.

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:04.170
I had no fever, yet Nsomehow I wasn't myself.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.840
Somehow I was weary Nto my very bones,

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:12.580
...and I continued to have Nterrifying nightmares.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.450
Tomoko stopped by on her Nway home from school.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:20.590
Would you mind if we Nwent to the beach?

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.850
Of course not!

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:36.850
Playing sick, right?

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:42.010
What a phony you are!

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:44.340
You owe me for the cake.

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:46.010
What are you talking about?

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:48.150
Be nice, or I'll charge you interest!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.020
Well, here's the first payment then.

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:55.220
Here! A souvenir, from the lake!

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:57.360
Oh, great!

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:05.960
Guess what! Miya-sama Nwas looking for you today.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:06.830
What?

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:08.830
So, what was it that Nhappened at her place?

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:12.500
No... nothing to speak of! NI had such a great time.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.340
What a luxurious mansion!

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:17.910
Walking around, enjoying the Nview, listening to music...

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:23.450
So! How about a race? Let's race!

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.390
To the breakwater Nup ahead. Let's go!

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:28.990
Nanako..!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:32.390
All right then!! Wait!

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.470
I'm home!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.210
Phone call for you... NFrom Ichinomiya-san.

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:53.280
What?!

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.350
What's wrong?

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.350
I'll take it in my room.

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:11.030
Umm... Hello?

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:15.000
I heard you were absent today...

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.500
Do you have a cold?

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:17.900
Y... Yes.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:19.970
How are you feeling?

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:23.380
I... well... my fever is gone.

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:27.910
So... I'll see your smiling face Nagain at school tomorrow?

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:31.250
Uh... Yes! I'll be at school tomorrow.

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:33.050
Thank goodness.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:37.390
Then, staying home had nothing Nto do with what happened.

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.860
No... nothing.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.000
I'm really sorry.

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:45.800
It was just because Nyou looked so cute.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:49.940
Playing a little trick on you Nwas irresistible... that's all.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:52.000
It's okay.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:57.780
Changing the subject... it was Ndecided at today's sorority meeting,

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:04.420
... that junior members will serve Nthe guests at my birthday party.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:08.220
Won't you help us, Nanako-san?

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.490
My Dear Brother...

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:16.160
Miya-sama's voice made my Nwhole body become tense.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.900
My hand on the receiver Nwas wet with cold sweat.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.570
I couldn't wait for the Nconversation to end.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:25.570
Thank you.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:26.970
Good night.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:33.250
But... those things Nthat happened...

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:36.520
I can't talk about them. NTo anyone.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.920
Say, Nanako-san!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:48.460
...did you decide on a present Nfor Miya-sama's birthday?

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.130
Oh, not yet. What about you?

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.730
It's a secret!

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:57.220
You've seen them, Nthe other members...

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:00.150
...they're all trying to find out Nwhat each other's presents are.

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:05.350
They want to buy Miya-sama's favor with expensive gifts.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:06.500
Hmmmm...

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:10.880
Well, I can tell YOU, I guess.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:13.690
Don't tell the other members.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:16.090
What? Red roses?

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:18.890
Yes, the gorgeous red Nroses that she loves...

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:22.630
I'm going to fill up her Nbanquet room with them!

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:25.830
I arranged it all with the Nflower shop at the Hotel Royale.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:28.240
What!

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.840
Sorry, sorry! NI was held up at my club.

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:42.850
Wow, gorgeous!

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:46.150
...2,3,4,5,6 zeros!

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:46.190
Those things are all Ntwo or three zeros off!
...2,3,4,5,6 zeros!

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:49.190
Those things are all Ntwo or three zeros off!

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:50.990
Have you lost your mind, Nanako?

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:52.260
Just looking!

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:54.930
I can't afford it, even Nif I stand on my head!

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:57.060
That would be my NDad's monthly salary!

00:09:58.270 --> 00:09:59.570
That's true!

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.340
Oh! Over here!

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:03.600
Wha... What?

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:07.070
That's Medusa-no-Kimi.

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:09.540
That will be all.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:13.210
Certainly. It's a pleasure Nto serve you, madam.

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:16.330
Please give our regards to Nyour father and mother.

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:21.360
Wow! She must have bought Na present for Miya-sama!

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:22.560
Yes.

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:24.020
-- sigh --

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:27.110
All the nice things are Ntoo expensive for me.

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:29.230
There's nothing I can afford here.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:32.500
Give up on the idea of Ncompeting with money.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:33.700
But...

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.970
You don't have any, Nin the first place...

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:38.770
Thanks a lot! I'll tell Father that.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.810
Instead you can compete with... this!

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:45.000
This, you say?

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:50.250
Yes indeed! How about Nyour famous cookies?

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.190
That's just the same old thing.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:55.060
Having your own style is really IT.

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:58.130
It is so much like you!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.730
We all call you "Cookie Nanako"! N{ i1} { i0}

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:00.590
We all call you "Cookie Nanako"! NWhat?

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:04.300
To my Dad, Mom, brother, Nand even our hamster, Pochi.

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.800
What? Pochi too?

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:08.670
Good morning.

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:10.860
Good morning.

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:13.870
Sorry to call you at this early hour.

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.610
Quite all right.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:19.080
Isn't it the day you go Nto the promontory?

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.280
Yes, to the promontory, please.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.710
There's still a wisp of fog...

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:49.380
Still, the ocean is beautiful Nhere, this morning.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:52.380
It's quiet... calm.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.850
It's always like this when NI come to visit you.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:58.320
You know already...

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:02.520
...that Fukiko-sama will Nbe turning 18, soon.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:17.470
Is this the anniversary Nof your mother's death?

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:31.890
Time passes by - it's already been N3 years since your Mother died.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:37.430
Yes. Then, your recommendation Ngot me into Seiran Academy.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.900
You rented an apartment for me,

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.230
...and gave me a monthly Nallowance to live on.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:45.300
It's nothing.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:48.640
It's really nothing to Nthe Ichinomiya family.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.640
Even though we had Ndifferent mothers,

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.910
...we do share the same father.

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:03.990
By the way, my birthday Nparty is this coming Sunday.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.120
Won't you come? Please?

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:13.060
Being my only sister.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:32.350
Happy 18th birthday, Miya-sama.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:33.820
Thank you...

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.350
What could it be?

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:37.890
Oh, I love it!

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:41.020
A diamond necklace, made in Italy.

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:42.930
Happy birthday!

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:43.960
Thank you.

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:50.300
Your favorite French perfume.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:51.430
Thank you.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:56.910
Happy birthday!

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:00.440
A rose, your favorite kind.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:05.510
And, in celebration of Nyour 18th birthday,

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:07.980
...another one thousand, seven Nhundred, and ninety nine!

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:12.390
Oh my.

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:17.860
How incredibly beautiful.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:23.800
How can I...?

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:28.140
Look at these presents! NWill she really like mine?

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:32.410
Nanako-san, what are Nyou doing? It's your turn!

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:39.820
Ha... happy Birthday!

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:44.290
Um... Here. Backed for Nyou, from my sincere heart.

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:50.690
Home-made? Thank you so much.

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:53.230
It's so like you!

00:14:57.970 --> 00:15:00.770
Does anyone have any Nmore gifts to present?

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:05.310
In 30 minutes, our Nguests will be arriving.

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:12.780
Now, junior members should prepare Nto serve our guests, please.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.320
Yes ma'am.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:34.000
Have some! This is port wine.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:38.740
Welcome! Hors d'oervres Nare being served over there.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:29.060
Damn, I think we're a little late.

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:30.390
Let's go.

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:31.720
OK.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:53.020
Welcome! We'll take Ncare of your things...

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:55.750
Would you sign the Nguest register, please?

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:58.620
Thank you very much.

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:00.560
My brother...!

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.040
Um... Good evening!

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:14.110
Hi! You look very nice today.

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:18.580
I had such a wonderful Ntime at the university fair.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.710
Thank you so much.

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.050
Sorry!

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.050
It's OK, it's nothing.

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:30.190
But...

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.190
Thank you.

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.600
I hope it's not going to stain.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.310
Nanako-san!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.400
What are you doing?

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:46.540
There are guests over there Nwho need fresh drinks.

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:50.020
Oh... of course! Excuse me!

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:57.350
I forced him to come.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:01.220
Otherwise he would have Nspent all day in the lab.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:04.690
Welcome.

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:07.090
Sorry to barge in like this.

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:09.290
Happy birthday!

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:16.370
Thanks.

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:27.510
Mariko-san! More whisky and water.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:29.180
Making some now.

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:30.650
Here you go.

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:31.500
Thank you.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:35.250
Would you care for Nwhisky and water?

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:37.120
I'll take one.

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:39.990
Good evening.

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:43.330
Saint-Juste-sama! NWhen did you get here?

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.330
I've been here a while.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:47.330
You just didn't notice.

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:49.130
Oh? I'm sorry...

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:52.670
I'm kidding. I just got here.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:54.140
Oh! Saint-Juste-sama!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.070
Won't you play something?

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.210
Won't you please?

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.080
Play something for Miya-sama!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.240
Please, won't you?

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:04.820
Well, for the Guest of Honor then.

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:17.960
It was unbelievable.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.830
At such a wonderful party,

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:24.970
...I could never have guessed Nwhat would happen next.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.110
No one could have.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:07.680
This is the song!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:10.950
The one Miya-sama played Nat her country home!

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.200
You... you shameless bitch!

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:06.270
"Shameless bitch"?

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:12.210
Fukiko-sama!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.100
Fukiko-sama!

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:29.760
I'm sorry, everyone... please Ngo on with the party...

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:34.700
She'll be back shortly... so please... Nenjoy yourselves... please!

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:38.370
Why? Why, Fukiko-sama?

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:41.370
What could I have done?

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.780
That song!

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:45.110
"That song"?

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:46.780
That melody...

00:21:47.510 --> 00:21:50.450
...is the one I hate Nthe most in the world!

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:51.990
No!

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:55.260
I was sure you loved that song!

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:59.330
You used to play it! NI've head you play it!

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:01.660
Many times! Over and over!!

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:07.670
Fukiko-sama!

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:08.940
Go home!

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:12.070
I never wanted you here anyway!

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:35.960
Shinobu-san... we can Ntake you home in our car.

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:37.560
No thank you!

00:22:37.900 --> 00:22:39.770
But, it's raining!

00:22:41.770 --> 00:22:43.500
Nanako-san, watch Nwhat you're doing!

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.000
Don't let a man talk you Ninto sharing your umbrella!

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:55.980
That incident brought Nan end to the party.

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
Neither Mariko-san nor NI knew what to say.

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:09.200
We walked to the Nstation without a word.

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:15.470
Such a happy little party...

00:23:15.470 --> 00:23:18.340
...to end in such Na violent storm.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:01.300 --> 00:25:04.700
PREVIEW

00:25:05.580 --> 00:25:08.720
Though Rei played a song Nshe thought Fukiko loved,

00:25:08.720 --> 00:25:12.590
...it somehow caused Fukiko Nto explode at her with rage.

00:25:13.050 --> 00:25:16.860
So, Rei seeks out an Nexplanation from Takashi,

00:25:16.860 --> 00:25:18.460
...to ease her torment,

00:25:18.530 --> 00:25:21.400
...and learns of the shocking Nevents of 6 years earlier!

00:25:22.000 --> 00:25:22.930
Next episode: N{ i1} { i0}

00:25:22.930 --> 00:25:24.130
Next episode: NEncore

00:25:24.470 --> 00:25:26.100
Brother, Dear Brother... N{ i1} { i0}

00:25:26.100 --> 00:25:28.940
Brother, Dear Brother... NThere is no end to my tears...
